# LAST AISLE - cutscene art: the story between the stores, drawn side-on like a picture book.
# Backdrops are layered (sky, far city, ridge, ground...) and tinted per shot by the engine, so most layers
# are painted in neutral daylight values. Tileable layers repeat horizontally. See STYLE.md for the format.

# --- skies: 4px columns tiled across, [0] night [1] dawn [2] overcast [3] dusk [4] rain [5] fog [6] inferno [7] golden sunset
